/* =============================================================
   data/sites/deep-dives.js — Holy sites, relics and mysteries
   The places and objects the "lost history" channels keep coming back
   to, each with three parts: what it is, what the lost-history side
   claims, and what the evidence shows. Facts were checked against the
   linked Wikipedia article (and the studies named in the text) on
   2026-10-15 (Shorts days 4–11 additions on 2026-10-27; days 12–29 on 2026-11-10). `deities` / `texts` link to records already in the app.
   ============================================================= */

